    "reason": "The changelog line [ev-3f8015970328] and the PR title [ev-a41275245e63] only say that \"credentials sync manifests\" were removed. The changed-files list [ev-e8ebdd2b5a6e] partly names the subject: files under manifests/integrations/ were deleted, including the eventhub-credentials-sync bases and cronjobs and the Makefile. That list is cut off after 6 of 57 files, so the full set of removed integrations is unknown. None of the evidence says whether these manifests were a published interface that users consumed (for example as remote kustomize bases), whether anything replaces them, or what happens to setups that referenced them. We need the PR description or the rest of the file list, plus an upgrade note on replacement or impact, before we can assert who is exposed and what happens to them.",
